# Project Hints: Agent Env Public

## Overview
Public-facing version of the agent-environment package (PyPI: agent-environment).

## Structure
- `agent_env/` — Python package for multi-agent environment management
- `bun.lock`, `bunfig.toml` — Bun runtime config
- `README.md` — Public docs
- `LICENSE` — Open source license

## Key Commands
- `pip install agent-environment` — Install from PyPI
- `agent-env sync` — Generate beacons

## Rules
- This is the public OSS version — no internal credentials or secrets
- Keep documentation generic and reusable
